; Rich-diagnostics demo: a misspelled key on a closed form trips
; `unknown_key`, and the rich format suggests the nearest declared key.
;
;   sjon validate --format=rich --no-project examples/unknown-key-typo.sjon
;
; This file is also the receipt behind the landing page's "errors a
; model can repair" card, and its schema is mirrored by the LLM pack's
; examples/llm/flows/01-unknown-key/. Keep the three in sync.
(plugin :name demo :version "1.0.0"
  (form :name camera
    (key :name mode :type symbol :optional true)
    (key :name zoom :type number :optional true)))

(camera :mode ortho :zom 2)
